    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86388" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρίσ-μα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>anything sawn, sawdust,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				5.6.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				11.207
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Lucill.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Gp.</u>
				4.15.9
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. λωτοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					<u>Eup.</u>
					2.50
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαρμάρου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aët.
					12.64
				</span></i>
			; <i>rotten wood,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.66
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>wound resulting from trephining with a saw,</i>
			
